el deactivate knowledge-graph-memory succeeded; activation read [INACTIVE]; restored and reactivated, everything green. HONEST LIMITS (kgRecordLimits): the first live run reached ~2400 nodes in 3 hops - hub-bounded traversal (degree > 25 reached-never-expanded, declined count reported) is what makes answers answers; common-word seeds still fan wide (34 seeds for 'approve') and the row cap plus totals keep that visible rather than hidden; coverage means reached-beyond-seed, not correct - keel why faithfully returns what was written, including what was written badly (D0161's own words)."; }
